mstances inside the country, but who have not applied for asylum in the country in which they are present. As indicated in the Guidance Note on International Protection Considerations for Venezuelans (May 2019), UNHCR considers that the majority of Venezuelan nationals or stateless persons who were habitually resident in Venezuela, are in need of international protection under the criteria contained in the Cartagena Declaration on the basis of threats to their lives, security or freedom resulting from events that are seriously disturbing public order in Venezuela. In line with the Secretary General’s Guidance, UNHCR and IOM have been coordinating closely to respond to the outflow of Venezuelans."},"raw_files":{"persons_of_concern.csv":{"label":"UNHCR Refugee Data Finder download (persons_of_concern.csv)","header":["Year","Country of Asylum","Country of Origin","Country of Asylum ISO","Country of Origin ISO","Refugees","Asylum-seekers","IDPs","Other people in need of international protection","Stateless persons","Host community","Others of concern"]}},"raw_rows":{"persons_of_concern.csv#L102690":{"file_key":"persons_of_concern.csv","line":102690,"row":["2019","Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic of)","Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic of)","VEN","VEN","0","0","0","0","0","0","494503"]},"persons_of_concern.csv#L103532":{"file_key":"persons_of_concern.csv","line":103532,"row":["2020","Brazil","Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic of)","BRA","VEN","46675","90934","0","163754","0","0","0"]},"persons_of_concern.csv#L108180":{"file_key":"persons_of_concern.csv","line":108180,"row":["2020","Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic of)","Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic of)","VEN","VEN","0","0","0","0","0","0","1112517"]},"persons_of_concern.csv#L109020":{"file_key":"persons_of_concern.csv","line":109020,"row":["2021","Brazil","Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic of)","BRA","VEN","48931","85738","0","175992","0","0","0"]},"persons_of_concern.csv#L113756":{"file_key":"persons_of_concern.csv","line":113756,